{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33596","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 五 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三纪吟诗望一名，丹霄待得白头成。\n已期到老还沾禄，无复偷闲却养生。\n当宴每垂听乐泪，望云长起忆山情。\n朱门旧是登龙客，初脱鱼鳞胆尚惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}